nts.")', '  },', '  "general_note_part": {', '    "gn1_general_notes": "HC_N refers to the unmatched local calibration set (n=998) used to fine-tune pre-trained BrainChart models to unseen scanners. Age statistics for this calibration HC set were not reported; matched HC (n=196) age summary is provided. Pre-training cohort size/age range (N=58,835; 2–100 years; 82 sites) reported for model origin. All analyzed clinical participants were male."', '  }', '}']
